			"widgets_values":[
				"Hyper-realistic F1 live TV broadcast style. 0-5 seconds, the woman slightly approaches the monitor in the garage, her lips nervously moving, while tightly grasping the cord of the headset microphone, with subtle breaths and blinks, the tense and excited expression intensifies. 6-10 seconds, the woman excitedly raises her hands, her expression exhilarated.2-10 seconds，女子说：还剩一圈了，干他，干他，拿个冠军，晚上爽一个。Voice: excited and tense, Pace: fast and emotional. Background crowd ambience, headset radio chatter, garage monitor beeps, distant F1 engine sounds, cinematic sports broadcast atmosphere，无字幕\nUltra-realistic F1 live TV broadcast style. Within 10-12 seconds, close-up shot, the woman's emotions become visibly more agitated, with her eyebrows locked, eyes widened, mouth open, and she shouts fiercely, with her hand clenched tightly to her lips. After 12-14 seconds, the camera zooms to a medium shot, with slight handheld shaking and aggressive live broadcast composition, the woman's expression becomes more tense and focused. Bright paddock lights reflect in her eyes, blurred LED screens and moving lights of the racing drivers behind her, natural skin texture and realistic sweat details. 14-16 seconds，女子说：快快快，给它丢个手雷，别让那龟孙子超了！Voice: loud, urgent, emotionally charged. Loud engine roar increases, intense team radio static, crowd cheering rises, fast-paced sports tension ambience，无字幕\nAn ultra-realistic broadcast style of Formula One (F1) racing. Within 16-18 seconds, two F1 cars compete fiercely in a high-speed corner, with their wheels touching as they enter the turn. After losing control, both cars violently slide into the gravel area outside the track, with carbon fiber fragments flying outwards and sparks and smoke filling the entire frame. Within 18-20 seconds, the camera quickly tracks the leading car as it rounds the corner, suddenly swerving during the collision. The car crashes and explodes, with intense zooming and jittery reaction shots in live TV broadcast, creating a realistic sense of replay of racing sports. Bright daylight track lighting, tire smoke, gravel splashes, sparks, dynamic blur, and film-style broadcast compression artifacts create a dramatic racing atmosphere. Within 20-23 seconds, the two cars collide, the cars explode, flames shoot up into the sky, the sound of collision impact, cars catching fire and exploding, shocked crowd reactions, commentators shouting excitedly, chaotic racing atmosphere, no subtitles，无字幕"
