				"Ultra-realistic elevator selfie POV style, vertical phone framing. 0-5 seconds, the beautiful woman leans against the elevator mirror, holding her phone up high with one hand, the other hand fixing her hair nervously. Her lips part slightly as if about to speak, eyes darting between the camera and her own reflection, quick shallow breaths fog the mirror slightly. 6-10 seconds, she bites her lip, eyes narrowing into a seductive smile, then tilts her head playfully. Within 10-12 seconds, she rapidly steps back, full-body shot now visible, her hand brushes down her waist and hip in one smooth motion, mouthing silent words with deliberate exaggeration. 12-14 seconds, the elevator doors suddenly slide open behind her—revealing a bright, modern living room with soft beige sofas, a glass coffee table, and warm pendant lights. 14-16 seconds，女子说：到家了宝贝，今晚别走了。Voice: breathy, confident, inviting. Pace: slow then fast, teasing. Background: soft elevator hum, muffled hallway footsteps, distant TV murmur from the living room, no subtitles"
